WEBVTT

00:07.549 --> 00:10.552
[car engine revving]

00:11.220 --> 00:14.223
[dog barking]

00:18.602 --> 00:20.812
[slurping]

00:21.730 --> 00:22.731
[car engine shuts off]

00:25.567 --> 00:26.777
[car door opens]

00:26.860 --> 00:28.820
Hey, come here.
Help me take care of this.

00:38.830 --> 00:40.082
[Farmer exhales]

00:40.165 --> 00:42.584
[Farmer] What is this?
You didn't chop it up?

00:43.627 --> 00:45.170
What am I supposed to do with it?

00:45.254 --> 00:48.298
Well, I got into some shit.
Help a brother out.

00:48.382 --> 00:50.217
Nobody told me.

00:51.677 --> 00:52.803
You're from Yes Money?

00:52.886 --> 00:54.930
Course I am.
We've met a few times already.

00:55.013 --> 00:56.974
Moonsu and the other guys aren't with you?

00:57.057 --> 00:58.850
Moonsu?

00:59.268 --> 01:02.312
Moonsu's probably at work right now.
Duh.

01:05.232 --> 01:06.316
[exhales sharply]

01:06.733 --> 01:08.402
[Woogy] Just do me this favor.

01:15.450 --> 01:16.702
[exhales]

01:16.785 --> 01:18.370
[Farmer grunts]

01:19.121 --> 01:21.456
[Farmer] Who the fuck brings uncut meat?

01:23.041 --> 01:26.044
[bag scraping]

01:28.839 --> 01:30.257
I appreciate this!

01:31.174 --> 01:34.761
[machine buzzing and clanging]

01:34.845 --> 01:37.472
[bones crunching]

01:39.016 --> 01:40.976
[pigs snorting]

01:48.650 --> 01:50.861
[slop squelching]

01:50.944 --> 01:53.947
[crows cawing]

02:02.706 --> 02:04.750
[Heeju breathing heavily]

02:06.460 --> 02:07.461
[knock at door]

02:07.544 --> 02:08.545
[gasps]

02:09.504 --> 02:12.507
[knocking continues]

02:20.641 --> 02:23.435
[door creaks]

02:23.518 --> 02:26.271
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

02:26.355 --> 02:27.356
Heeju.

02:29.733 --> 02:30.734
I'm hungry.

02:31.526 --> 02:32.611
[chuckles]

02:33.570 --> 02:35.656
[Woogy] Oh, I'm so fucking starving
right now!

02:36.156 --> 02:37.199
[Woogy groans]

02:38.325 --> 02:39.576
[door locks]

02:40.994 --> 02:42.913
[broth splashing]

02:42.996 --> 02:45.999
[exhales heavily]

02:46.083 --> 02:48.669
[slurping]

02:48.752 --> 02:52.464
[slurping continues]

02:53.590 --> 02:54.591
[huffing]

02:59.304 --> 03:02.307
[Woogy slurping]

03:02.683 --> 03:03.850
[Woogy exhales]

03:07.312 --> 03:09.272
Ah.

03:12.067 --> 03:13.068
[exhales]

03:14.861 --> 03:15.862
Heeju.

03:17.739 --> 03:19.282
You know, my dad...

03:21.159 --> 03:22.744
...he was the same kind
of asshole as your uncle.

03:24.287 --> 03:26.164
He brought our whole family down
with his gambling addiction.

03:27.332 --> 03:29.126
That piece of shit should
have just died alone.

03:29.751 --> 03:31.420
He even tried to kill my mom and I.

03:33.463 --> 03:34.464
Anyway...

03:40.011 --> 03:41.221
[Woogy] Don't give it another though.

03:42.180 --> 03:43.432
[Woogy] I took care of the body.

03:44.683 --> 03:46.643
[Woogy] There's not a single shred
of flesh left.

03:46.726 --> 03:47.978
Don't worry about it.

03:49.521 --> 03:50.689
[grunts]

03:54.151 --> 03:56.403
This one?
This one's mine?

04:03.618 --> 04:05.245
I said don't worry!

04:08.039 --> 04:09.040
Just let it go.

04:09.124 --> 04:10.125
[smacks lips]

04:12.586 --> 04:15.422
[Woogy] I mean, that was a man
who deserved to die.

04:18.175 --> 04:20.135
[Heeju] A man who deserved to die?

04:20.927 --> 04:21.928
[Woogy] Mm-hmm.

04:23.221 --> 04:24.514
[exhales]

04:25.474 --> 04:26.475
Hey.

04:28.143 --> 04:30.020
You see how important money is now?
STYLE
::cue()

04:32.189 --> 04:33.732
It makes the world go 'round.

04:35.484 --> 04:38.737
Like, having money lets you do
anything you could ever want.

04:38.820 --> 04:41.740
[Woogy] And it also lets you
not do things you don't want.

04:43.617 --> 04:44.701
[Woogy] Oh, yeah.

04:45.702 --> 04:48.371
[Woogy] Here you go.
As promised.

04:48.455 --> 04:49.456
[Woogy] Your new ID card.

04:49.539 --> 04:51.291
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
JU HARAN

04:51.374 --> 04:52.375
I just went through all our debtors,

04:52.459 --> 04:54.211
and then I picked out who looked
like you the most.

04:54.294 --> 04:56.963
[Woogy] We can take care of the passport
and fingerprints and all that later.

04:57.047 --> 05:00.675
[Woogy] But for starters,
open a bank account under her name.

05:01.927 --> 05:05.055
Well, obviously we're about
to have piles of cash rollin' in.

05:05.347 --> 05:07.974
So, can't exactly keep
it all piled up in here.

05:08.266 --> 05:09.267
Hmm?

05:09.351 --> 05:11.061
Who is this lady?

05:11.645 --> 05:12.813
[Woogy] Ah, this lady...

05:14.815 --> 05:15.816
...she's dead.

05:17.317 --> 05:18.401
It was suicide.

05:19.069 --> 05:20.070
A year ago.

05:21.863 --> 05:22.989
So they say.

05:25.408 --> 05:27.619
[Woogy] She doesn't exist in
the world anymore.

05:27.702 --> 05:30.455
No one is looking for her,
and there's no way to find her.

05:30.539 --> 05:32.290
[Woogy] And someone that young...

05:33.250 --> 05:36.419
...you really think she had any money?
They took her organs.

05:36.503 --> 05:39.297
[Woogy] She just doesn't exist.
She's gone.

05:42.300 --> 05:46.137
I'll also turn out like that,
if I get caught by your company people.

05:48.640 --> 05:49.850
So be good.

05:51.560 --> 05:52.561
Or else.

05:55.564 --> 05:57.274
[chuckles]

05:57.357 --> 05:59.860
Anyway, we need to wrap
this whole thing up quickly.

05:59.943 --> 06:03.238
[Woogy] Since Detective Kim
is even involved now,

06:03.321 --> 06:04.364
it's a huge deal.

06:04.447 --> 06:06.992
I bet the guys at Yes Money
are desperate to find you.

06:07.075 --> 06:08.076
What do we do?

06:08.869 --> 06:10.912
[Woogy] We got eight potatoes left, right?

06:10.996 --> 06:13.123
Let's craft and sell two
at a time now.

06:13.999 --> 06:17.752
After selling so many one-kilo bars,
I realized how fucking easy it is.

06:17.836 --> 06:19.170
If I just run my ass off,

06:19.254 --> 06:20.797
hitting all the jewelry shops,

06:20.881 --> 06:22.257
I can sell 20 in three days.

06:22.591 --> 06:23.842
[Woogy] It could be done in two weeks.

06:24.426 --> 06:25.427
[Woogy] In the meantime,

06:25.510 --> 06:27.304
you should get your passport ready to go.

06:27.387 --> 06:29.598
Then we'll go overseas.
Simple.

06:33.059 --> 06:34.060
What is it?

06:36.438 --> 06:38.565
You still don't trust me after all this?

06:39.524 --> 06:40.525
[Woogy] Heeju.

06:41.109 --> 06:43.486
[Woogy] We're way past being
just business partners now.

06:44.863 --> 06:46.948
I even killed a man because of you.

06:48.658 --> 06:50.577
We're like bound by fate now.

06:50.660 --> 06:51.786
[chuckles]

06:51.870 --> 06:53.288
Bound by fate.

06:53.371 --> 06:54.664
[Woogy chuckles]

06:54.748 --> 06:56.207
[Woogy] I better get going.

06:57.959 --> 06:59.753
How many potatoes
are you bringing next round?

06:59.836 --> 07:01.046
Two.

07:01.129 --> 07:03.214
Correct.
Where do they need to go?

07:03.298 --> 07:04.966
To the shop.

07:05.050 --> 07:06.760
Correct.
Where do you get those?

07:08.845 --> 07:10.013
I guess not. Okay.

07:10.096 --> 07:11.514
You're too smart!

07:11.598 --> 07:13.016
I'm out.

07:14.225 --> 07:16.144
Ah, fuck, I'm so tired.

07:16.227 --> 07:18.396
[Woogy chuckles]

07:18.480 --> 07:20.482
[door creaks closed]

07:20.565 --> 07:23.568
[distant car engine rumbling]

07:25.445 --> 07:28.448
[clock ticking echoing]

07:33.870 --> 07:36.873
[♪ sad piano music]

08:01.022 --> 08:04.025
[♪ music continues]

08:16.079 --> 08:19.666
EPISODE 5
SECRET

08:19.749 --> 08:21.543
JANGGAK TRADE INC.

08:21.626 --> 08:23.420
[Donggu] Can I help you?

08:23.503 --> 08:26.715
Uh, hi.
I want to buy a car today.

08:26.798 --> 08:27.799
You're here to get a car?

08:27.882 --> 08:29.384
-[Heeju] Yes.
-Ah.

08:29.467 --> 08:31.136
How did you hear about us?

08:31.219 --> 08:33.096
I run a pawnshop.

08:33.763 --> 08:34.806
You run a pawnshop?

08:34.889 --> 08:37.100
-[grunts]
-[Donggu] All right.

08:38.184 --> 08:40.145
Let me show you our cars.

08:40.228 --> 08:42.772
-Okay.
-Any particular type car you had in mind?

08:42.856 --> 08:44.274
Uh, no, not really.

08:44.357 --> 08:45.942
No, okay then.

08:46.026 --> 08:47.027
Well, if that's the case,

08:47.110 --> 08:49.821
then this one here
is probably what you're looking for.

08:49.904 --> 08:51.698
[Donggu] It has good mileage,
plus it's practically brand new.

08:51.781 --> 08:52.991
Huh.

08:53.074 --> 08:55.201
[machine rattling]

08:55.285 --> 08:59.205
[Donggu] Now all you gotta do is take this
to the district office

08:59.289 --> 09:00.707
and transfer the title.

09:00.790 --> 09:02.083
-Okay.
-Here.
STYLE
::cue()

09:03.001 --> 09:05.670
-You can take the car today.
-Thanks.

09:05.754 --> 09:09.674
Actually, I was curious
about your pawnshop.

09:09.758 --> 09:10.967
[stammers]

09:11.051 --> 09:14.012
Is it here around the Jeongsan area?

09:14.846 --> 09:15.847
[exhales]

09:15.930 --> 09:17.307
Why do you ask?

09:17.390 --> 09:20.393
It's just that there's not
a pawnshop I don't know around here.

09:21.978 --> 09:24.731
It was originally run by a relative,
and something came up,

09:24.814 --> 09:26.524
so I ended up taking it over.

09:26.608 --> 09:27.859
Ah.

09:27.942 --> 09:31.071
I was wondering,
where do all the cars end up going?

09:31.154 --> 09:33.448
Most of 'em?
Eh...

09:34.866 --> 09:36.242
[Donggu] Most of 'em end up overseas.

09:36.326 --> 09:38.745
What about the other collateral,
besides the cars?

09:38.828 --> 09:41.956
Those other items normally end up
overseas, too.

09:42.415 --> 09:43.416
More or less.

09:43.500 --> 09:47.128
[Heeju] You only ship items overseas
and don't ship anything back in?

09:50.131 --> 09:52.801
For a young lady,
you sure are curious about all this.

09:53.510 --> 09:54.511
-Uh...
-[Donggu] I mean,

09:54.594 --> 09:55.970
you're askin' a lot of questions.

09:56.054 --> 09:58.473
Are you a cop
or someone from customs?

09:58.556 --> 10:00.975
No, it's nothing like that.
I'm just really curious.

10:01.059 --> 10:02.060
Actually, up until recently,

10:02.143 --> 10:05.021
I used to be in a similar line
of work as you.

10:05.105 --> 10:07.440
Checking imported goods,
clearing them for entry.

10:10.193 --> 10:12.070
Oh, really?

10:12.153 --> 10:14.948
Uh, one more thing.

10:16.199 --> 10:19.035
We've had this for a while,
just hanging around the pawnshop.

10:20.620 --> 10:25.625
[Heeju] And I was wondering
if you had any bullets for it.

10:26.668 --> 10:30.296
It's just sometimes working late
nights alone can be kinda scary.

10:31.464 --> 10:32.507
[Heeju] Hopefully I never have to use it,

10:32.590 --> 10:35.760
but just having it would make
me feel so much safer.

10:36.678 --> 10:38.930
Yeah. Is that so?

10:39.472 --> 10:40.557
You're a surprising young lady.

10:41.599 --> 10:43.143
I can give you however much you want.

10:43.226 --> 10:44.978
[Donggu] It's not about the money.

10:45.061 --> 10:46.938
Smuggling is just not what I do.

10:48.773 --> 10:50.567
Is it that you can't,
or that you won't?

10:50.650 --> 10:51.651
[Donggu chuckles nervously]

10:51.734 --> 10:53.403
Listen, I'm guessing since
you're new in town,

10:53.486 --> 10:55.113
you haven't heard of me before.

10:55.196 --> 10:56.781
Do I look like someone who can't to you?

10:56.865 --> 10:58.324
Maybe I just don't wanna.

10:58.408 --> 11:01.244
I was thinking if you
could get this for me,

11:01.327 --> 11:03.538
then there could be other things
you could help me with.

11:03.621 --> 11:04.873
[inhales sharply]

11:04.956 --> 11:06.958
However, if it's something
that you don't do, then...

11:08.877 --> 11:11.754
What other sort of things
did you need help with?

11:11.838 --> 11:14.507
Well, I don't know.

11:14.591 --> 11:16.926
There's nothing that
a pawnshop doesn't have.

11:19.804 --> 11:20.805
Detonics.

11:22.640 --> 11:24.184
Wait here a second while
I go get them for you.

11:29.314 --> 11:30.481
[door opens and shuts]

11:30.565 --> 11:32.567
[inhales and exhales sharply]

11:34.360 --> 11:35.862
[door opens and shuts]

11:35.945 --> 11:38.072
[Donggu breathing heavily]

11:38.156 --> 11:39.157
[grunts]

11:40.074 --> 11:41.993
So, have you fired a gun?

11:42.076 --> 11:43.536
Uh, no.

11:44.537 --> 11:47.165
It's not like I'd actually have
a reason to use it.

11:47.248 --> 11:48.333
Uh-huh.

11:48.917 --> 11:50.877
First insert the magazine.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.128
[magazine clicks]

11:52.212 --> 11:54.172
[Donggu] Like that.
After that,

11:54.255 --> 11:57.175
you grab this part and slide it back.

11:57.258 --> 11:58.718
[Donggu] When you do that,

11:58.801 --> 12:00.803
a bullet will be chambered here.

12:00.887 --> 12:02.430
And since it's very dangerous,

12:02.513 --> 12:04.766
you need to always keep the safety up,

12:04.849 --> 12:06.935
like so,
until you need to fire.

12:07.393 --> 12:08.811
It's the same with the trigger.

12:08.895 --> 12:11.981
Until you're ready,
your finger stays back here.

12:12.899 --> 12:13.942
[Donggu] And when you shoot,

12:14.025 --> 12:17.028
always hold it with both hands.

12:17.403 --> 12:18.529
Just like so.

12:18.613 --> 12:20.949
[Donggu] Most women find
the recoil pretty strong.

12:21.908 --> 12:24.118
You see this?
This waving?

12:24.869 --> 12:27.372
Any sort of movement affects
your accuracy.

12:28.456 --> 12:29.540
[Donggu] The head and heart.

12:29.624 --> 12:32.168
That's where you aim,
and if you don't hit them there,

12:32.252 --> 12:34.462
you keep shooting until they're dead.

12:34.545 --> 12:36.089
-Bang!
- [gasps]

12:36.172 --> 12:38.049
[Donggu] Bang, bang.
Bang, bang.

12:38.841 --> 12:41.010
You want to kill,
you keep shooting.

12:42.053 --> 12:43.054
Here.

12:45.765 --> 12:47.058
How much money do I owe you?

12:47.141 --> 12:48.351
Ah, no, no, no, no.

12:48.434 --> 12:50.603
I don't need money.
It's a gift from me to you.

12:51.980 --> 12:57.568
In return, how about from now on,
you only work with me?

13:10.623 --> 13:13.626
[car engine rumbling]

13:14.544 --> 13:15.628
[clicks tongue]

13:15.712 --> 13:16.921
[exhales]

13:21.801 --> 13:22.969
NAME JU HARAN
STYLE
::cue()

13:28.474 --> 13:31.477
[♪ dramatic piano music]

13:42.530 --> 13:44.365
[shovel digging]

13:44.449 --> 13:45.450
[grunts]

13:53.750 --> 13:55.126
[Heeju grunts]

14:07.972 --> 14:09.015
[gold bars clinking]

14:09.098 --> 14:10.808
[Heeju grunting]

14:12.518 --> 14:15.480
[Heeju] There's no one in this world
who deserves to die.

14:16.898 --> 14:18.649
I killed so I can live.

14:19.525 --> 14:20.526
That's all it is.

14:20.610 --> 14:21.986
[groans]

14:22.070 --> 14:24.238
[Heeju] Because I can't be
the one to die.

14:32.121 --> 14:33.122
[blows hard]

14:35.833 --> 14:36.876
[exhales]

14:38.461 --> 14:39.504
[Heeju grunts]

14:44.175 --> 14:45.176
[breathing heavily]

14:45.259 --> 14:48.262
[car engine rumbling]

14:49.430 --> 14:50.681
[grunts]

14:50.765 --> 14:53.059
[breathing heavily]

14:59.941 --> 15:01.067
[brakes squeak]

15:04.362 --> 15:08.366
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

15:20.378 --> 15:22.171
-[Sunok exhales]
-[Heeju] Auntie.

15:24.006 --> 15:25.133
[Heeju] How are you doing?

15:26.175 --> 15:27.468
[Sunok grunts]

15:30.012 --> 15:31.931
-[Sunok groans lightly]
-Yes?

15:32.014 --> 15:33.224
[Sunok exhales]

15:34.684 --> 15:36.144
[Sunok] Why are you still here?

15:36.686 --> 15:38.062
You should lie down.

15:39.272 --> 15:40.398
The cash I gave you.

15:41.274 --> 15:42.358
Did you return it?

15:44.110 --> 15:45.319
Is that...

15:45.403 --> 15:46.904
[Sunok] ...why he dropped the charges?

15:48.447 --> 15:49.574
Mm-hmm.

15:49.657 --> 15:50.741
[Sunok] You crazy bitch.

15:51.659 --> 15:53.369
Why didn't you run when I told you to?

15:53.452 --> 15:54.370
[shudders]

15:54.453 --> 15:55.872
You need to run away.

15:55.955 --> 15:57.582
Go quickly,
before he comes back.

15:57.665 --> 15:58.666
It's all right.

15:59.375 --> 16:01.460
That man won't ever come back again.

16:02.044 --> 16:03.629
I'm telling you, he will!

16:04.839 --> 16:06.674
And then the both of us
will be trapped here.

16:07.717 --> 16:10.845
He's already bleeding me dry.
That's more than enough.

16:12.180 --> 16:13.264
You-you have to go now.

16:13.347 --> 16:14.807
I don't have to.

16:16.267 --> 16:18.895
It's not like I have much time left.
I don't need you. Just hurry up and go.

16:18.978 --> 16:21.105
Aunty, that's why I'm not leaving you.

16:22.523 --> 16:25.526
What'll it take, then?
Should I hang myself?

16:25.610 --> 16:27.653
-[Sunok] Listen to me!
-No!

16:27.737 --> 16:30.114
[distant footsteps approaching]

16:32.116 --> 16:33.367
He has to be coming.

16:35.995 --> 16:37.246
He's coming, I said!

16:37.914 --> 16:39.457
You-you need to hide somewhere.

16:39.540 --> 16:41.375
-Look at me. Stop.
-[Sunok] Quickly.

16:41.459 --> 16:44.337
-You have to hide-
-[Heeju] Auntie. Auntie. Auntie.

16:45.463 --> 16:49.008
That asshole is never coming back.

16:49.967 --> 16:51.802
He can't come back.

16:53.512 --> 16:54.555
[Heeju exhales deeply]

16:56.515 --> 16:58.226
This time I made sure of that so now...

17:00.478 --> 17:01.938
...everything's gonna be okay.

17:08.694 --> 17:10.988
From now on,
I'll stay by your side.

17:11.572 --> 17:14.575
[Sunok inhales and exhales deeply]
STYLE
::cue()

17:18.746 --> 17:21.749
[distant sirens wailing]

17:23.209 --> 17:25.127
[Thai Businessman] My chairman's
losing patience now.

17:25.211 --> 17:27.171
All these construction delays.

17:28.339 --> 17:30.258
[Woojin speaking Korean]

17:32.301 --> 17:38.307
[speaking Korean]

17:42.770 --> 17:45.356
There are formal
legal protocols to follow.

17:45.439 --> 17:49.151
Once your chairman signs off,
we're ready to move immediately.

17:49.235 --> 17:50.945
Well, for that to happen,

17:51.028 --> 17:52.947
we're going to need a solid guarantee
from you guys.

17:53.030 --> 17:55.825
[speaking Korean]

17:56.909 --> 18:01.664
[Thai Businessman] Let's just say
we'll need a reason to move.

18:01.747 --> 18:03.332
[speaking Korean]

18:13.634 --> 18:15.052
What did he just say?

18:15.136 --> 18:17.847
[speaking Korean]

18:21.309 --> 18:25.229
He wishes to speak
with your chairman directly.

18:25.313 --> 18:26.939
No, what'd he say before that?

18:27.898 --> 18:29.817
[Gyuseok speaking Korean]

18:31.193 --> 18:34.196
[speaking Korean]

18:36.907 --> 18:40.870
[speaking Korean]

18:41.746 --> 18:42.997
[speaking Korean]

18:43.080 --> 18:46.083
[speaking Korean]

18:50.880 --> 18:52.548
[Woojin] The chairman says,

18:52.632 --> 18:55.468
"The coffin in Korea's
now your responsibility.

18:55.551 --> 18:58.429
So you will have to move it yourself."

18:58.512 --> 19:00.765
[speaking Korean]

19:18.783 --> 19:20.284
[chopsticks clatter on plate]

19:38.219 --> 19:40.888
Something like this
isn't complete without a drink.

19:42.932 --> 19:43.933
My chairman told me...

19:45.184 --> 19:47.061
...to take extra special care of you.

19:48.562 --> 19:50.606
He's committing everything
to this deal.

19:52.274 --> 19:53.943
[Woojin speaking Korean]

19:54.026 --> 19:56.904
[speaking Korean]

19:56.987 --> 20:01.033
[Woojin speaking Korean]

20:01.117 --> 20:02.410
[exhales sharply]

20:03.619 --> 20:04.870
[speaking Korean]

20:14.964 --> 20:15.965
How's it goin'?

20:17.216 --> 20:18.384
Dokyung hasn't opened his mouth yet?

20:18.467 --> 20:19.677
[snaps fingers]

20:21.470 --> 20:22.888
[Hocheol] I'm sorry.

20:22.972 --> 20:24.223
[Gyuseok] Hocheol, come on.

20:26.142 --> 20:27.309
[lighter flicks]

20:28.102 --> 20:29.520
Didn't you tell me not to worry?

20:30.271 --> 20:33.315
You said that bastard has nowhere to run
and that he's in your hands.

20:33.399 --> 20:34.900
[Gyuseok] So what now?

20:35.526 --> 20:39.280
[Hocheol] I'll go to the hospital myself,
then I'll shut him up.

20:39.363 --> 20:42.074
[Gyuseok] How, exactly?
You said the cops are involved.

20:42.158 --> 20:45.536
[Hocheol] I know a detective at
the Gangwon Central Police Department.

20:46.746 --> 20:50.708
I might need to buy a little time
to have a moment alone with Dokyung.

20:50.791 --> 20:52.168
[Gyuseok] And what
if he still doesn't talk?

20:52.251 --> 20:53.461
Kill him?

20:54.336 --> 20:55.713
How would we find the casket?

20:55.796 --> 20:56.922
[Hocheol] Worst-case scenario.

20:57.006 --> 21:00.885
Even if we have to give up the casket,
shutting him up is the priority.

21:03.345 --> 21:04.972
Ah.

21:06.724 --> 21:08.142
Is that right?

21:08.225 --> 21:09.935
That's the priority?

21:10.019 --> 21:12.021
[Gyuseok] I didn't realize that.

21:14.732 --> 21:15.733
Hey, Hocheol.

21:15.816 --> 21:17.610
[cigarette hissing]
STYLE
::cue()

21:18.819 --> 21:20.488
Are you the boss now?

21:20.571 --> 21:22.740
[Gyuseok] Do you get
to decide what's important?

21:25.034 --> 21:26.535
I'm sorry.

21:27.369 --> 21:29.330
I spoke out of turn.

21:29.413 --> 21:32.082
[Gyuseok] This bastard Lee Dokyung,
he married?

21:32.625 --> 21:34.877
As far as I know,
he's not married.

21:34.960 --> 21:36.128
Hocheol, listen.

21:36.212 --> 21:38.214
Cut off a finger from a friend
or a bitch close to him

21:38.297 --> 21:39.548
and send it to him.

21:39.632 --> 21:40.716
You think he won't talk after that?

21:40.800 --> 21:42.927
Yes, I'll get on that right away.

21:43.844 --> 21:46.514
When you find the casket,
don't open it right away.

21:47.807 --> 21:49.558
Give me a call first.

21:49.642 --> 21:51.268
I want to go check it myself.

21:52.478 --> 21:53.479
[Hocheol] Yes, sir.

21:55.940 --> 21:58.025
Hocheol, make sure you get this right.

21:58.108 --> 21:59.235
[exhales]

21:59.318 --> 22:01.445
[Gyuseok] That casket better be sitting in

22:01.529 --> 22:03.823
the hotel before I get back
from this trip.

22:03.906 --> 22:04.907
Understand?

22:07.284 --> 22:08.536
Right.

22:08.619 --> 22:09.829
But sir.

22:10.704 --> 22:11.705
That cask-

22:11.789 --> 22:12.790
[phone beeps]

22:12.873 --> 22:15.876
[♪ suspenseful music]

22:22.258 --> 22:25.886
AHN GYUSEOK

22:44.029 --> 22:46.866
[door opens and closes]

22:46.949 --> 22:49.159
FIELD INVESTIGATION REPORT

22:49.243 --> 22:51.078
[Jinman] So it turns out the window on
the driver's side

22:51.161 --> 22:53.205
of the van was slightly open.

22:53.289 --> 22:57.126
It's lucky I caught that,
which is pretty genius, don't you think?

22:57.209 --> 22:58.419
Yeah?

22:58.502 --> 22:59.795
It's pretty dark,
but take a look.

23:00.963 --> 23:01.964
[Jinman] You see it?

23:02.047 --> 23:02.965
[Jinman] Can you make it out?

23:03.883 --> 23:05.593
See? It's a woman.

23:06.760 --> 23:08.345
[Jinman] And out of all
the witnesses involved in

23:08.429 --> 23:10.723
the smuggling case who were questioned by
the police,

23:10.806 --> 23:15.311
there was only one woman who had been
on National Route 6 that day.

23:15.394 --> 23:18.147
And even better,
she was caught by surveillance cameras.

23:18.981 --> 23:20.566
All right, so who is she?

23:20.649 --> 23:22.192
I can let you know soon.

23:22.276 --> 23:23.736
I'll even find that casket, too.

23:23.819 --> 23:27.907
[Jinman] I just don't have
any hard evidence yet. Okay?

23:27.990 --> 23:29.658
I don't wanna cause problems
by barking up the wrong tree.

23:29.742 --> 23:31.243
[Hocheol] Hard evidence?

23:32.244 --> 23:35.372
It's not like we're running
a police investigation here.

23:35.456 --> 23:37.833
Maybe, but I'm still a cop, aren't I?

23:37.917 --> 23:39.960
Cut the crap and tell me who
the woman is now.

23:41.295 --> 23:42.296
[scoffs]

23:43.047 --> 23:44.048
Here.

23:45.674 --> 23:46.926
[clears throat]

23:50.554 --> 23:52.681
[Jinman] Head of Gangwon Security,
Cha Yujin.

23:52.765 --> 23:55.184
[Jinman] There's a good chance
she's Lee Dokyung's accomplice.

23:55.267 --> 23:57.269
I already planted a tracking device
on her car,

23:57.353 --> 23:59.396
so don't worry about that, 'kay?

23:59.480 --> 24:02.399
Once they head to Jeongsan,
we just follow 'em. Simple.

24:02.483 --> 24:04.777
When?

24:04.860 --> 24:06.028
She'll go sooner or later.

24:06.111 --> 24:08.322
She has to.
The casket's there.

24:10.157 --> 24:11.325
'Kay, good work.

24:11.408 --> 24:14.328
Do you wanna be paid in cash,
or do you want chips?

24:14.411 --> 24:16.080
I'll take chips.

24:16.163 --> 24:18.874
I'll have a table set up tomorrow.
Just use 100.

24:18.958 --> 24:21.543
But I haven't found the casket yet.

24:21.627 --> 24:24.338
That's enough for now.
I'll take care of the rest.

24:26.924 --> 24:27.925
Ah.

24:29.843 --> 24:31.178
Don't mention the gold.

24:32.304 --> 24:34.932
We should pretend we don't know.
Even around the chairman.

24:35.015 --> 24:37.977
[Hocheol] Actually, you know what?
Now that I think about it...

24:39.061 --> 24:41.522
...if the chairman were to find out you
and I know about the gold...

24:43.440 --> 24:44.984
...well, who knows what could happen?

24:45.067 --> 24:47.069
[Hocheol] I'm sure he didn't tell us
for a reason.

24:47.152 --> 24:50.030
Is that right?
So that's how it's gonna go.

24:51.991 --> 24:54.660
I guess that's how it is, then. Wow.

24:54.743 --> 24:56.203
[Jinman] Knowing Chairman Ahn,

24:56.286 --> 24:58.831
it couldn't have been easy
trusting someone with all that gold.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.791
[Jinman] Even if they were family.

25:01.375 --> 25:03.502
[Jinman] That's hard to do. Yeah.

25:04.795 --> 25:08.257
What if they see all that gold
and just totally lose their mind?

25:08.340 --> 25:10.926
[Jinman] Right? They could do
something crazy.

25:11.010 --> 25:13.470
That's why you told me to lay off.
Isn't that right?

25:13.554 --> 25:14.555
That's gotta be it.
STYLE
::cue()

25:17.683 --> 25:21.353
[sirens blaring]

25:21.437 --> 25:24.440
WARD 32

25:26.275 --> 25:27.484
[snapping fingers]

25:30.738 --> 25:33.073
Lee Dokyung.
When's he getting transferred?

25:33.157 --> 25:34.158
[exhales]

25:34.867 --> 25:35.993
Monday.

25:37.202 --> 25:38.454
Let me see him real quick.

25:39.121 --> 25:42.124
Well, unless you registered in advance,
I can't-

25:42.207 --> 25:43.333
Five minutes.

25:44.918 --> 25:45.919
[Kang groans]

25:46.754 --> 25:48.172
Five minutes.
I mean it.

25:51.759 --> 25:52.843
Okay.

26:04.980 --> 26:06.899
[Hocheol] No, no, no, no, no, no.
Sit down, sit down, sit down.

26:06.982 --> 26:07.983
I'm just here to talk.

26:09.568 --> 26:13.072
I promised Detective Kang I wouldn't
be more than five minutes.

26:14.323 --> 26:16.116
[exhales]

26:16.200 --> 26:18.786
[Hocheol] Looks like you're on the mend.
You're up and walking.

26:19.703 --> 26:20.704
How's your head?

26:21.246 --> 26:22.247
Is it okay?

26:22.331 --> 26:24.124
Like I've said before.

26:25.000 --> 26:27.086
Unless my money and my safety
are guaranteed...

26:28.045 --> 26:29.880
I won't be telling you anything.

26:31.632 --> 26:33.592
[inhales]

26:34.551 --> 26:36.095
Do you even know what's inside the casket?

26:37.054 --> 26:38.097
[Hocheol] You do, don't you?

26:38.972 --> 26:40.599
[Hocheol] Maybe you knew from the start.

26:40.682 --> 26:42.684
Or maybe your accomplice told you later.

26:44.353 --> 26:46.230
[Hocheol] It doesn't matter either way.

26:46.313 --> 26:47.731
I know why you're holding out.

26:51.485 --> 26:52.611
I wouldn't have said anything, either.

26:52.694 --> 26:55.197
[Hocheol] If I had a whole ton
of gold in my hands?

26:56.615 --> 26:58.367
I'd go all in.
I mean, what else is there?

26:58.450 --> 27:02.496
[laughing]

27:05.415 --> 27:06.667
I did some digging.

27:08.085 --> 27:11.505
It turns out your accomplice
was a woman.

27:14.800 --> 27:18.137
She works at the airport.
Yangpo, right?

27:18.220 --> 27:19.471
[Hocheol inhales sharply]

27:19.555 --> 27:20.764
[Hocheol] What's her name?

27:22.349 --> 27:23.517
Cha Yujin?

27:25.018 --> 27:26.478
[Hocheol] Your girlfriend.

27:26.562 --> 27:28.605
[Hocheol] I was thinking I should stop by
and meet her.

27:29.314 --> 27:31.024
[Hocheol] But if you don't
wanna make things messy,

27:31.108 --> 27:32.192
you should tell me what you know.

27:34.987 --> 27:36.864
Where's the casket?

27:38.657 --> 27:39.825
[light shuddering]

27:40.701 --> 27:42.202
I don't know where it is.

27:42.286 --> 27:44.121
Does Ms. Cha Yujin?

27:44.204 --> 27:46.832
It's not her.
She's got nothing to do with this.

27:47.916 --> 27:49.084
What are you getting at?

27:49.167 --> 27:50.210
She's not my girlfriend,

27:50.294 --> 27:51.920
and she doesn't know anything about
the casket.

27:52.004 --> 27:53.255
Then who does know?

27:53.797 --> 27:54.923
[sharp breathing]

27:57.175 --> 27:58.510
[exhales]

28:00.888 --> 28:01.889
[Hocheol] The thing is...

28:02.890 --> 28:04.016
...I don't have time for this.

28:07.102 --> 28:09.730
By the end of this week,
I have to find that casket.

28:09.813 --> 28:11.148
I don't care what it takes.

28:14.985 --> 28:16.778
So I was thinking about
this whole thing...

28:18.697 --> 28:20.240
...when I suddenly realized...

28:23.285 --> 28:25.454
...why even bother finding
your accomplice?

28:26.538 --> 28:27.664
She won't admit to anything.

28:27.748 --> 28:29.041
[laughs]

28:30.167 --> 28:31.251
Then you know what I thought?

28:33.253 --> 28:34.296
I should just kill them all.

28:35.339 --> 28:37.424
[Hocheol] Every single woman connected
to you.

28:38.342 --> 28:39.343
One...

28:40.302 --> 28:42.054
...after another.

28:43.889 --> 28:45.682
Girlfriend or not.

28:47.017 --> 28:49.853
[Hocheol] Whether she stole
the casket or not.

28:51.188 --> 28:52.898
Until you open up.

28:53.899 --> 28:54.900
You understand?

28:59.821 --> 29:02.240
[Hocheol] You got till tomorrow
to think it over and let me know.

29:09.623 --> 29:11.750
If you don't talk,
I'm really gonna kill them all.

29:13.502 --> 29:15.754
Starting with your girlfriend.
STYLE
::cue()

29:15.837 --> 29:18.840
[shuddering]

29:24.429 --> 29:27.349
[door slides open and closed]

29:32.813 --> 29:36.316
[machines quietly beeping]

29:41.738 --> 29:43.198
[Heeju exhales]

29:56.253 --> 29:58.046
[grunts]

30:03.427 --> 30:06.430
[indistinct chatter]

30:10.308 --> 30:11.560
[Jinman coughs]

30:17.107 --> 30:20.152
[cell phone vibrates]

30:22.279 --> 30:24.031
[phone trilling]

30:25.073 --> 30:26.783
[phone vibrating]

30:26.867 --> 30:28.410
-[Jinman] Hello?
-Hello?

30:28.493 --> 30:29.703
-[Jinman] Hello? Ms. Kim?

30:29.786 --> 30:31.246
[Hospital Announcer]
Patient is in the ward...

30:31.329 --> 30:32.873
-Are you there?
-[Heeju] I'm sorry I'm not available.

30:32.956 --> 30:35.792
Leave a message and I'll call you back.
Have a good day. Bye.

30:36.710 --> 30:38.003
[Hospital Announcer]
Patient is in the ward.

30:38.086 --> 30:42.299
The guardian of patient Kim Minseo,
please go to the reception desk.

30:51.308 --> 30:52.934
[door clangs and creaks]

31:09.242 --> 31:10.285
[exhales sharply]

31:12.829 --> 31:15.791
What were you doing here?

31:16.792 --> 31:17.918
Oh, not you.

31:20.212 --> 31:23.590
[car engines revving]

31:23.673 --> 31:26.676
[cell phone vibrating]

31:30.680 --> 31:33.100
-Hello?
-[Dokyung] It's me, Dokyung.

31:33.183 --> 31:34.434
[inhales]

31:35.227 --> 31:36.561
One moment.

31:43.318 --> 31:44.903
[Yujin] Are you still in the hospital?

31:44.986 --> 31:46.238
[Dokyung] Yeah.

31:47.114 --> 31:48.615
[Yujin] Are you crazy?

31:48.698 --> 31:49.908
Why are you calling me?

31:50.909 --> 31:52.536
[Dokyung] Take some time off work.

31:52.619 --> 31:54.287
[Dokyung] And go overseas for a while.

31:54.371 --> 31:55.497
Why should I?

31:56.206 --> 31:57.791
Is it the casket?

31:57.874 --> 31:59.417
[Dokyung] You're in serious danger.

31:59.501 --> 32:01.461
You need to get out
of the country right now.

32:05.465 --> 32:06.675
Fine.

32:06.758 --> 32:09.469
[Yujin] But first,
let me just ask you one thing.

32:10.595 --> 32:12.681
No one's listening in on our call, right?

32:13.849 --> 32:15.642
No.

32:16.768 --> 32:19.104
What on earth is inside of that casket?

32:22.149 --> 32:23.859
If it's too difficult
for you to say out loud,

32:23.942 --> 32:26.903
just answer my questions.
It's not drugs, right?

32:26.987 --> 32:28.280
[Dokyung] It's not.

32:28.363 --> 32:29.990
Is it gold?

32:31.533 --> 32:33.618
[Yujin] The X-ray picked up
a high-density material,

32:33.702 --> 32:35.162
like metal.

32:35.245 --> 32:37.497
No mechanical parts,
like with firearms,

32:37.581 --> 32:41.209
but more like solid masses of metal
with no impurities.

32:41.293 --> 32:43.503
[Yujin] But you wouldn't have brought
in something like iron.

32:46.506 --> 32:48.091
Just tell me the truth.

32:48.175 --> 32:50.302
I promise I'll leave
the country like you said.

32:56.224 --> 32:57.225
[Yujin] Fine, then.

32:57.851 --> 32:58.935
[phone beeps]

32:59.019 --> 33:00.103
[exhales]
STYLE
::cue()

33:14.034 --> 33:15.035
[car alarm beeps]

33:15.118 --> 33:18.121
[indistinct chatter]

33:18.496 --> 33:21.041
TEMPORARILY CLOSED
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

33:21.124 --> 33:24.127
[gate clanging]

33:26.588 --> 33:28.256
[keys jangling]

33:28.340 --> 33:29.507
[exhales]

33:36.306 --> 33:38.391
[Heeju] Shit.

33:40.143 --> 33:42.062
[panicked breathing]

33:48.401 --> 33:52.572
[cell phone vibrates]

33:52.656 --> 33:55.075
TEAM LEADER CHA YUJIN

33:56.910 --> 33:57.911
[phone clicks]

34:02.916 --> 34:04.626
[phone buzzes rapidly]

34:05.585 --> 34:06.670
[exhales]

34:08.546 --> 34:09.798
[Yujin] If you don't call me,

34:09.881 --> 34:11.591
I'll tell the police
that you're in Jeongsan.

34:16.638 --> 34:19.891
[cell phone vibrating]

34:34.155 --> 34:35.240
Hello?

34:37.951 --> 34:39.244
Is this how I get you to call?

34:39.327 --> 34:41.121
[Yujin] Are you avoiding me?

34:41.204 --> 34:43.290
Uh, no, not at all.

34:43.373 --> 34:45.208
[Yujin] I'm on my way to Jeongsan now
to see you.

34:47.877 --> 34:48.878
Why?

34:48.962 --> 34:50.422
[Yujin] It must be hard on you,

34:50.505 --> 34:52.465
considering what's inside that casket.

34:52.549 --> 34:54.342
I can help you.

34:56.386 --> 34:59.222
Really?
So what's inside of it?

34:59.306 --> 35:01.349
[Yujin] You know very well
what's inside it.

35:02.392 --> 35:04.936
I'll call you when I get there.
Let's have a drink somewhere quiet.

35:15.196 --> 35:18.533
[Heeju] Now there was one more person
besides Woogy.

35:18.617 --> 35:21.870
One more person who knew I
had the gold bars.

35:22.871 --> 35:26.458
I need to find out how much she know.

35:26.541 --> 35:29.669
[clocks ticking]

35:29.753 --> 35:32.672
[♪ lively music playing]

35:32.756 --> 35:35.759
[indistinct lively chatter]

35:45.477 --> 35:48.021
[Yujin] Hi! You're here!

35:50.940 --> 35:52.192
[Yujin] Whoo, whoo!

35:52.275 --> 35:53.610
Whoo!

35:54.486 --> 35:56.821
[Yujin] Hurry up! Hi!

35:59.240 --> 36:00.659
[Yujin] You didn't bring your car,
did you?

36:00.742 --> 36:02.452
Let's drink till we drop.

36:02.535 --> 36:04.287
No, I drove here.

36:04.371 --> 36:06.081
Why? That's no fun.

36:08.041 --> 36:09.959
You said you wanted
to talk someplace quiet.

36:10.043 --> 36:13.755
I did. It's better to have quiet convos
in loud places.

36:14.756 --> 36:17.509
All right, go ahead, then.
I can't be gone long.

36:18.635 --> 36:19.886
Come on.

36:20.387 --> 36:22.597
Sweetie, why are you so grumpy?

36:22.681 --> 36:24.557
[Yujin] Keep this up
and you'll hurt my feelings.

36:25.517 --> 36:26.768
[Yujin] The thing is...

36:28.061 --> 36:31.272
...I spoke with Dokyung on
the phone before I came here.

36:31.356 --> 36:32.774
The casket.

36:34.442 --> 36:37.112
[Yujin] He asked me to help you get
it out of the country.

36:37.195 --> 36:39.239
And he even told me what's inside of it.

36:40.657 --> 36:42.450
What's inside of it, then?

36:44.452 --> 36:45.787
Gold bars.

36:48.123 --> 36:49.249
[Yujin exhales]

36:49.332 --> 36:51.584
[Yujin] But don't take it the wrong way.

36:51.668 --> 36:54.963
I guess he just thought I
was more reliable than you

36:55.046 --> 36:56.339
when it came to moving them.

36:57.382 --> 36:59.300
So where's the casket now?

37:03.555 --> 37:05.223
I guess he didn't tell you that part.

37:05.306 --> 37:06.933
Mm-hmm.

37:07.016 --> 37:09.102
'Cause he told me I should just ask you.

37:10.103 --> 37:11.271
[exhales]

37:11.354 --> 37:13.148
You're lying to me.

37:13.231 --> 37:15.400
He would never tell you about
the gold bars.

37:16.401 --> 37:17.694
He really did, though.

37:20.739 --> 37:24.409
[Yujin] But that's not important.
You really are naive.

37:24.492 --> 37:28.329
It really doesn't matter who Dokyung loves
or whether you believe me
STYLE
::cue()

37:28.413 --> 37:30.165
or don't believe me.
None of it matters.

37:30.248 --> 37:33.251
[Yujin] If he gets his hands on
the gold bars,

37:33.334 --> 37:34.335
the outcome is the same for us.

37:35.837 --> 37:36.963
It's Lee Dokyung.

37:37.046 --> 37:40.884
He's not gonna share it with you
or me or any other woman.

37:46.473 --> 37:48.057
I have Cha Yujin's location.

37:48.975 --> 37:50.602
Yes, in Jeongsan.

37:51.186 --> 37:54.189
Yeah. Yeah, the club in front
of Gold Land.

37:55.148 --> 37:57.066
[Jinman] But I have no idea
if she's still there or not.

37:57.609 --> 37:59.360
'Kay, good work.

37:59.444 --> 38:00.612
[phone beeps]

38:01.988 --> 38:04.115
That asshole has no fucking manners.

38:05.492 --> 38:07.035
It's Jeongsan.

38:07.118 --> 38:08.453
Jeongsan Hobak Nightclub.

38:08.536 --> 38:09.913
Are you saying she's here in town?

38:09.996 --> 38:11.539
She's probably looking
for the casket.

38:12.582 --> 38:14.918
Share Cha Yujin's photo.
Call the boys.

38:15.001 --> 38:16.169
Don't just sit there!

38:16.252 --> 38:18.588
[nervous breathing]

38:18.671 --> 38:19.881
[Hocheol] Hey!

38:19.964 --> 38:21.966
Do it right!

38:22.050 --> 38:24.427
If anyone loses her, I swear
I'll cut off one of their fucking ears.

38:24.511 --> 38:25.804
Okay.

38:27.472 --> 38:28.765
[cell phone vibrating]

38:32.185 --> 38:34.521
SENT A PHOTO: PRESIDENT KO

38:34.604 --> 38:37.273
[Gitae] Meet up at Jeongsan
Hobak Nightclub. Find this woman.

38:42.737 --> 38:44.739
[cell phone beeps]

38:44.823 --> 38:48.493
[phone trilling]

38:49.661 --> 38:52.372
[motorcycle engine revving]

38:56.334 --> 38:58.253
[Yujin] As of right now,

38:58.336 --> 39:01.798
the police suspect
I'm Dokyung's accomplice.

39:01.881 --> 39:06.219
And I'm pretending I don't know anything
since it's currently better that way.

39:08.054 --> 39:11.099
I don't know how much longer
I can keep this up, though.

39:12.016 --> 39:14.853
[Yujin] Honestly, there's no reason
for me to get on the suspect list just

39:14.936 --> 39:16.187
to protect you.

39:20.024 --> 39:22.485
You want the gold.
Is that what it is?

39:22.569 --> 39:24.362
Mm-hmm.

39:26.739 --> 39:29.576
You got it. Bingo.

39:31.202 --> 39:32.787
The deal will be different.

39:34.163 --> 39:35.206
You know what I think?

39:35.290 --> 39:37.625
We should just split it between
the two of us.

39:38.293 --> 39:39.752
Hear me out.

39:39.836 --> 39:41.754
[Yujin] You're the one holding all
the cards right now.

39:41.838 --> 39:45.508
And since you are,
you get to call the shots.

39:46.676 --> 39:49.512
Do you wanna hand everything over
to Lee Dokyung?

39:49.596 --> 39:52.098
[Yujin] Or do you wanna split
it fifty-fifty with me?

39:53.016 --> 39:58.229
[Yujin exhales]

39:58.313 --> 40:01.107
[Yujin] Look, there's only one way
this'll end if you go it alone.

40:01.190 --> 40:04.152
What'll you do?
Hold onto the gold for months?

40:05.653 --> 40:09.073
All the cops already know the casket
is right here in Jeongsan.

40:09.157 --> 40:10.491
And even if you were lucky enough

40:10.575 --> 40:13.578
to hold onto the gold all that time,
then what?

40:13.661 --> 40:17.582
The second Lee Dokyung gets out,
he's gonna take it all away from you.

40:17.665 --> 40:19.709
Even though you were
the one who did all the work.

40:22.670 --> 40:23.838
Here's what I think.

40:26.549 --> 40:27.967
[Yujin] We have no choice.

40:28.051 --> 40:29.969
We have to get that casket out of here.

40:31.095 --> 40:32.096
Overseas.

40:33.056 --> 40:36.434
The same way it was brought in through
the airport in the first place.

40:36.517 --> 40:40.313
And can you think of anyone else who
could pull that off better than me?

40:43.733 --> 40:45.652
[Male Waiter] All right.

40:45.735 --> 40:48.071
Here's the fruit platter. And...

40:48.988 --> 40:50.949
...this one's on the house.

40:51.032 --> 40:52.742
Have a fun night.

40:55.995 --> 40:57.246
[indistinct lively chatter]

40:57.330 --> 41:00.083
[♪ lively club music playing]

41:00.166 --> 41:02.001
[drink sizzling]

41:05.880 --> 41:07.090
You wanna try?

41:07.173 --> 41:09.342
Oh, this?

41:10.385 --> 41:12.845
I heard this is what
the kids call Rainbow.

41:14.097 --> 41:16.391
'Cause it makes you feel great
when you take it.

41:27.110 --> 41:28.945
Why don't you think it over some more?

41:29.028 --> 41:30.405
I'm gonna go have fun.

41:36.160 --> 41:37.245
[Heeju exhales sharply]
STYLE
::cue()

41:38.913 --> 41:40.707
HOBAK, ADULT-ONLY ENTERTAINMENT
NIGHTCLUB

41:42.625 --> 41:44.961
[Club Guard] Evening.
Welcome in.

41:49.048 --> 41:50.341
-[Gitae] Hey, Moonsu!
-[Moonsu] Yes, sir.

41:50.425 --> 41:51.676
[Gitae] Stand guard at the back door.

41:51.759 --> 41:52.927
-[Moonsu] Yes, boss.
-[Gitae] Okay.

41:53.011 --> 41:54.012
[Gitae] Stay sharp, everyone!

41:54.095 --> 41:55.096
[All] Yes, sir!

42:00.059 --> 42:02.729
[crowd cheering]

42:02.812 --> 42:05.815
[♪ loud club music playing]

42:07.567 --> 42:09.277
[cell phone vibrates]

42:14.240 --> 42:15.616
MISSED CALL
WOOGY

42:16.701 --> 42:18.745
[Woogy] Isn't this your boss?

42:22.915 --> 42:25.752
[Clubgoer A] Oh, move, move. Oh.

42:25.835 --> 42:28.087
-[Clubgoer B] What's going on?
-[Clubgoer B] Stay away from them.

42:28.171 --> 42:29.464
[Clubgoer A] Stay out of their way.

42:31.049 --> 42:32.717
[Gitae] Hey, you all have the photo,
right?

42:32.800 --> 42:35.011
-[All] Yes, sir!
-[Gitae] Okay. Spread out and find her.

42:35.094 --> 42:36.471
[Henchman] Yes, sir!

42:36.554 --> 42:37.972
[Gitae] Hold up. You two wait here.

42:38.056 --> 42:39.307
[Both] Yes, sir.

42:39.390 --> 42:40.767
-[Gitae] And you!
-[Clubgoer A] Come on, come on.

42:40.850 --> 42:42.060
[Clubgoer A] We'll find another club.

42:43.770 --> 42:46.189
[panicked breathing]

42:46.272 --> 42:48.274
[cell phone chimes, trills]

42:50.651 --> 42:51.861
Hey, what's going on?

42:51.944 --> 42:53.529
Where'd you get that photo?

42:53.613 --> 42:55.698
Well, is it your boss or not?

42:56.282 --> 42:57.283
It's her, right?

42:58.159 --> 43:00.787
Seems my company is after her.
I hear she's in Jeongsan.

43:00.870 --> 43:03.206
What? Where in Jeongsan?

43:03.289 --> 43:05.124
[Woogy] Uh, Jeongsan Hobak Nightclub.

43:06.834 --> 43:09.504
Wait, where are you?
Why is it so loud?

43:10.379 --> 43:12.090
Hold on. Are you with her?

43:12.965 --> 43:15.009
You better get the fuck outta there!

43:15.093 --> 43:17.678
[indistinct chatter]

43:22.475 --> 43:24.268
[Woogy] I'm telling you, my company's
looking for her right now.

43:24.352 --> 43:26.395
If you stay there,
you're gonna get caught.

43:28.439 --> 43:29.732
Shit.

43:29.816 --> 43:30.817
[Woogy] I'm on my way to the workshop,
okay?

43:30.900 --> 43:33.152
You gotta just ditch her and get out.

43:39.617 --> 43:40.910
Are you there?

43:40.993 --> 43:41.994
Hello?

43:42.078 --> 43:43.079
Heeju.

43:44.539 --> 43:45.540
Hel-

43:47.416 --> 43:48.417
This is bad.

43:49.460 --> 43:52.463
[breathing erratically]

43:54.590 --> 43:58.010
[indistinct loud chatter]

44:06.686 --> 44:10.398
Excuse me. Excuse me, sorry.
Sorry. 'Scuse me.

44:10.481 --> 44:11.983
Ms. Cha, we have to leave now.

44:12.066 --> 44:14.777
-Wh-What? Why?
-They're here to get you.

44:14.861 --> 44:15.903
[Yujin] Who? Who's here?

44:16.821 --> 44:18.781
[Heeju] What do I do?
Ah, shoot.

44:18.865 --> 44:19.782
What?

44:19.866 --> 44:21.117
-[Hocheol] Where d'you think you're going?
-[Yujin] What's going on?

44:21.200 --> 44:22.994
-[Heeju] This way.
-[Gitae] Hold on a sec.

44:24.787 --> 44:27.248
Sorry. Sorry about that.

44:29.125 --> 44:30.126
Shit.

44:30.209 --> 44:31.502
He's gone.

44:35.423 --> 44:38.426
[both breathing heavily]

44:46.517 --> 44:48.269
[gate creaking]

44:50.354 --> 44:51.355
This way.

44:52.356 --> 44:54.192
[both breathing heavily]

44:54.275 --> 44:55.985
[Yujin] He's coming! Run!
Hurry, hurry!

44:57.528 --> 44:59.989
-[Heeju] Here, I think it's this way.
-[Jinman] Hey! Cha Yujin!

45:00.072 --> 45:02.074
[Yujin] Run! Run, he's coming!

45:02.158 --> 45:04.202
-[Heeju] Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah, keys.
-[Jinman] Hey! Hey!

45:04.285 --> 45:05.745
[Jinman] Cha Yujin!
STYLE
::cue()

45:05.828 --> 45:08.414
[Jinman] Wait! Cha Yujin!
Open the door!

45:08.497 --> 45:10.499
[Jinman] Hey!

45:10.583 --> 45:11.667
No, wait! Stop!

45:11.751 --> 45:14.170
-Stop! Hey!
-[Yujin] Drive! Drive!

45:14.253 --> 45:15.379
No!

45:15.463 --> 45:16.839
[car engine revving]

45:16.923 --> 45:18.049
[car horn honks]

45:18.132 --> 45:19.508
[breathing heavily]

45:20.551 --> 45:22.511
[Jinman] There's two of 'em?

45:22.595 --> 45:25.514
[labored breathing]

45:25.598 --> 45:28.768
[both breathing heavily]

45:28.851 --> 45:30.144
Ah, shit.

45:30.228 --> 45:32.271
[Yujin] How did they know where
to find us?

45:36.776 --> 45:39.111
-[Heeju] Ah, shit.
-Do you think they're cops or something?

45:41.405 --> 45:43.324
Those guys aren't detectives.

45:43.407 --> 45:44.951
Huh?

45:45.034 --> 45:47.703
They're from Yes Money,
a loan shark company around here.

45:48.371 --> 45:51.415
They're the ones who smuggled
the casket in.

45:51.499 --> 45:53.376
And Kim Jinman, the detective,

45:53.459 --> 45:54.877
this whole time he's been in on it, too.

45:56.545 --> 45:58.589
If we get caught by the cops,
we go to jail.

45:59.632 --> 46:01.801
We'll be out in a year or two.
But if we get caught by those guys...

46:04.387 --> 46:06.806
...the gold bars won't be
the only thing we lose.

46:06.889 --> 46:08.391
We'll both lose our lives.

46:08.474 --> 46:10.810
[Yujin] Shit, no wonder.

46:10.893 --> 46:12.770
There was something off about
that fucking detective.

46:14.522 --> 46:17.566
Oh, so that's why that asshole Dokyung
said I should leave the country.

46:18.567 --> 46:19.944
[exhales sharply]

46:21.195 --> 46:22.947
So what do we do now?

46:23.030 --> 46:25.866
We have to be smart.
There's no room for taking chances.

46:27.201 --> 46:29.870
Okay, sweetie.
You need to make a decision.

46:31.289 --> 46:32.373
Is it me or Dokyung?

46:32.456 --> 46:33.916
Does that really matter right now?

46:34.625 --> 46:36.794
If those guys back there catch us,
then we're dead.

46:36.877 --> 46:39.255
So what?
I'll die whenever I'm gonna die!

46:40.548 --> 46:41.841
Come on, sweetie.

46:42.508 --> 46:44.260
Let's go get the gold together.

46:45.052 --> 46:46.345
[groans]

46:55.604 --> 46:57.023
[tires squeak]

46:58.357 --> 47:01.360
[gate rattling]

47:02.945 --> 47:03.946
[keys jangle]

47:04.030 --> 47:05.239
[lock clicks]

47:05.323 --> 47:07.283
[door squeaks]

47:14.248 --> 47:15.958
[door creaking]

47:20.087 --> 47:21.130
Do you live here?

47:22.548 --> 47:24.884
-Well, for the time being.
-Oh.

47:30.431 --> 47:32.433
Didn't you say that you lived
with your aunt?

47:33.225 --> 47:34.518
She's in the hospital.

47:36.020 --> 47:37.396
[Yujin] Oh.

47:37.480 --> 47:39.106
So you're alone, then.

47:41.692 --> 47:43.611
You can stay here until it's light out.

47:43.694 --> 47:45.029
Sleep in that room over there.

47:46.072 --> 47:48.491
And I'll come back tomorrow.

47:49.825 --> 47:51.077
[Yujin] Why? Where are you going?

47:52.453 --> 47:53.537
To get the gold?

47:54.830 --> 47:55.831
[Heeju] Huh?

47:55.915 --> 47:58.709
[electric sizzling]

48:00.628 --> 48:01.629
[Heeju groans]

48:07.009 --> 48:08.386
[thuds]

48:09.095 --> 48:10.388
[Yujin exhales]

48:11.722 --> 48:13.099
[chuckles]

48:18.938 --> 48:20.481
[deep exhale]

48:23.359 --> 48:26.362
[ticking clocks echoing]
STYLE
::cue()

48:30.574 --> 48:33.786
[Moonsu] Woogy, you asshole,
you didn't show. Where are you?

48:33.869 --> 48:36.330
[Woogy] I told you, I'm going to Daejeon
to get President Jo.

48:37.748 --> 48:38.749
Where are you?

48:39.667 --> 48:40.751
You nearby?

48:40.835 --> 48:43.754
Oh, yeah. That chick.
Were you able to get her?

48:43.838 --> 48:46.549
-Cha Yujin?
-[Moonsu] We fuckin' lost her.

48:46.632 --> 48:49.009
Look, the boss is here,
and he's really pissed off, too!

48:49.093 --> 48:50.719
Says he's gonna cut off everyone's ears,
man.

48:51.679 --> 48:52.930
That's her, right?

48:53.013 --> 48:55.224
The woman?
She stole the casket.

48:55.307 --> 48:57.518
-Dokyung's accomplice?
-[Moonsu] Of course she is!

48:57.601 --> 49:00.146
So finish up whatever you're doing
and get your ass over here.

49:00.229 --> 49:01.647
'Kay, I'll be there.

49:01.730 --> 49:03.941
[flames roaring]

49:04.024 --> 49:05.151
[phone beeps]

49:05.776 --> 49:06.902
Whew!

49:06.986 --> 49:08.320
Shit, that's lucky.

49:09.321 --> 49:10.364
CONNECTING CALL...
HEEJU

49:10.448 --> 49:13.451
[phone trilling]

49:21.625 --> 49:23.627
Ah, come on.
Why isn't she picking up?

49:23.711 --> 49:24.962
[phone beeps]

49:36.182 --> 49:39.185
[♪ suspenseful music]

49:41.437 --> 49:42.813
[exhales]

49:44.899 --> 49:47.902
[tires rumbling]

50:01.207 --> 50:02.708
[exhales]

50:02.791 --> 50:05.002
[muffled shouting]

50:05.085 --> 50:07.755
[cell phone vibrating]

50:13.969 --> 50:15.930
[phone buzzing]

50:25.564 --> 50:28.067
[Woogy] Hello? Uh, Heeju.
Where are you?

50:28.150 --> 50:30.027
-Why didn't you answer?
-[muffled shouting]

50:30.110 --> 50:31.237
You there?

50:31.320 --> 50:32.863
[Heeju shouting muffled]

50:32.947 --> 50:34.448
You hear me?

50:34.532 --> 50:36.825
I can't hear you.
What are you saying?

50:36.909 --> 50:38.744
[door opens]

50:38.827 --> 50:40.037
[Heeju grunts]

50:42.248 --> 50:43.832
[Yujin] Poor baby.

50:48.045 --> 50:50.005
You hid the gold bars in the mine,
didn't you?

50:51.257 --> 50:53.717
[Yujin] I saw coal caked all over
the car tires.

50:54.552 --> 50:55.594
[Yujin] Here.

50:55.678 --> 50:59.265
[Yujin] The coal mine at the end
of National Route 7, right?

50:59.348 --> 51:00.391
Inside the drift.

51:00.474 --> 51:02.226
[Yujin] Huh? Huh?

51:02.309 --> 51:04.395
-Right?
-Ms. Cha! Ms. Cha, wait!

51:04.478 --> 51:05.646
You won't find them on your own.

51:05.729 --> 51:07.231
I'm the only one who knows
exactly where they are.

51:07.314 --> 51:08.399
I'll go with you!

51:08.482 --> 51:11.569
[Heeju] We can go together
and split the gold bars, okay?

51:11.652 --> 51:13.279
Now you're saying that?

51:13.362 --> 51:16.115
[Yujin] Well, too late.
I don't need you.

51:16.198 --> 51:17.658
I'll look all night if I have to.

51:17.741 --> 51:19.493
I'll just use a metal detector
or something.

51:21.620 --> 51:23.247
You really are naive.

51:23.330 --> 51:25.708
Do you honestly think Lee Dokyung
and I keep you around

51:25.791 --> 51:27.334
because you actually matter?

51:27.418 --> 51:29.044
[Yujin] It's like I already told you.

51:29.128 --> 51:32.631
The only reason you were useful
was because of the gold.

51:32.715 --> 51:33.841
Not because we need you.

51:33.924 --> 51:35.134
-I beg you.
-[Yujin] Yeah?

51:35.217 --> 51:36.302
[gasps]

51:36.385 --> 51:38.262
[Heeju] Let's split them!

51:38.846 --> 51:41.473
[Heeju gasping]

51:41.557 --> 51:42.600
[Heeju wails]

51:42.683 --> 51:44.602
Please!

51:44.685 --> 51:46.478
[muffled shouting]

51:47.354 --> 51:51.442
[Yujin] You know, I was wondering what
to do with you.

51:51.525 --> 51:53.319
[Yujin] I was a bit conflicted.

51:53.402 --> 51:55.154
But you just helped me make up my mind.

51:56.322 --> 51:59.617
Yeah. Someone like you doesn't deserve
the gold.

51:59.700 --> 52:01.660
[muffled screaming]

52:01.744 --> 52:03.287
[door opens and closes]

52:04.872 --> 52:05.873
[car door beeps]

52:07.499 --> 52:08.959
[car engine turns over]

52:09.043 --> 52:10.669
[engine revving]

52:10.753 --> 52:12.963
[tires squeal]
STYLE
::cue()

52:14.381 --> 52:16.133
[Yujin] Just drink this
and never wake up.

52:17.676 --> 52:19.053
[Yujin] You think you're in love,
but the truth is,

52:19.136 --> 52:20.763
you're leeching off of Dokyung.

52:20.846 --> 52:23.015
And even after your life is wrecked,

52:23.098 --> 52:26.560
you still cry out,
"I was truly in love." Right?

52:26.644 --> 52:28.687
You've spent your whole life
telling yourself that.

52:28.771 --> 52:30.939
[Heeju whimpering]

52:31.023 --> 52:32.733
[Yujin] Sweetie.

52:33.651 --> 52:35.444
[Yujin] You really wanna go on
living like that?

52:35.527 --> 52:37.071
[Heeju groaning]

52:37.154 --> 52:38.614
Just die.

52:39.823 --> 52:42.826
[muffled shouting]

52:45.621 --> 52:47.164
[coughing]

52:47.247 --> 52:48.749
[bottle clatters]

52:48.832 --> 52:52.294
[both breathing heavily]

52:52.378 --> 52:54.254
Goodnight, sweetie.

52:54.338 --> 52:56.090
Forever.

52:56.173 --> 52:59.176
[♪ tense music]

53:02.596 --> 53:04.473
[coughing]

53:12.314 --> 53:15.484
[Heeju grunting]

53:20.698 --> 53:22.366
[muffled coughing]

53:38.966 --> 53:40.384
[lights buzzing loudly]

53:40.467 --> 53:43.178
[Heeju groaning]

54:07.161 --> 54:10.164
[grunting continues]

54:13.459 --> 54:16.462
[coughing]

54:20.883 --> 54:23.343
[gasping]

54:23.427 --> 54:26.388
[breathing heavily]

54:26.472 --> 54:29.141
[door creaking]

54:30.184 --> 54:33.187
[labored breathing]

54:40.027 --> 54:42.029
[coughing]

54:43.530 --> 54:46.533
[car approaching]

54:46.617 --> 54:47.826
[gags]

54:51.830 --> 54:53.457
[Woogy] Whoa! Heeju!

54:53.540 --> 54:54.791
You 'kay?

54:54.875 --> 54:56.168
Get up.

54:56.251 --> 54:57.753
You okay?

54:59.630 --> 55:00.797
Where're you going?

55:00.881 --> 55:01.882
[gasps]

55:01.965 --> 55:03.217
[Woogy] Huh?

55:04.009 --> 55:05.761
-I have to go.
-Where you tryin' to go?

55:05.844 --> 55:08.096
The mine?
Let's take my car.

55:08.639 --> 55:11.183
-You can't. Don't follow me.
-Ah, come here!

55:11.266 --> 55:14.269
[both grunting]

55:15.604 --> 55:17.439
-[Woogy] Okay.
-[Heeju] Cha Yujin.

55:17.523 --> 55:20.526
[both grunting]

55:23.278 --> 55:25.697
[gold bars clinking]

55:25.781 --> 55:27.533
[grunting]

55:38.710 --> 55:39.878
I heard everything on the call.

55:39.962 --> 55:41.880
That bitch, Cha Yujin.

55:42.589 --> 55:43.966
That woman really drugged
the fuck out of you.

55:44.049 --> 55:46.093
[Woogy] And she's heading to the mine
to steal the gold.

55:46.843 --> 55:47.928
Hurry up.

55:48.971 --> 55:50.514
She probably went to get her car.

55:52.182 --> 55:55.727
If we go now,
we can get there before her.

55:55.811 --> 55:57.980
Fucking Cha Yujin.
STYLE
::cue()

55:58.063 --> 56:01.525
[car engine revving]

56:01.608 --> 56:04.611
[lights buzzing]

56:16.498 --> 56:17.499
[car alarm beeps]

56:28.427 --> 56:29.803
[grunts]

56:29.886 --> 56:31.638
[car door opens]

56:31.722 --> 56:32.973
Huh?

56:33.056 --> 56:34.057
[car door closes]

56:35.434 --> 56:36.435
Cha Yujin?

56:38.770 --> 56:39.771
Yes.

56:41.064 --> 56:42.065
[chuckles]

56:44.443 --> 56:46.028
Where's the casket?

56:47.362 --> 56:48.363
Huh?

56:51.033 --> 56:53.327
[Yujin] Uh, the casket?

56:58.415 --> 56:59.416
[Yujin grunting]

56:59.499 --> 57:02.502
[both struggling]

57:02.586 --> 57:04.546
-[gasping]
- Fucking bitch.

57:05.339 --> 57:07.424
I'm afraid I'm a little impatient.

57:07.507 --> 57:09.301
So I don't have time to listen
to your excuses.

57:09.384 --> 57:10.927
Sorry about that.

57:11.011 --> 57:12.220
I'll ask one more time.

57:12.304 --> 57:15.182
[Yujin gasping]

57:15.265 --> 57:17.392
Where's the gold.

57:17.476 --> 57:20.479
[Yujin gasping]

57:20.562 --> 57:23.440
No! I-I didn't steal it!
I didn't-

57:23.523 --> 57:25.359
-What I took-
-Really?

57:25.442 --> 57:28.570
-[Hocheol grunting]
-[Yujin gasping]

57:37.746 --> 57:38.747
[Kang] Take this call.

57:44.920 --> 57:45.962
[grunts]

57:49.341 --> 57:51.051
[exhales]
Hello?

57:51.134 --> 57:53.387
[Yujin] Do-Dokyung.

57:53.470 --> 57:56.807
[Yujin gasping]

57:56.890 --> 57:58.058
Yujin.

57:58.141 --> 57:59.518
Captain, right now...

58:00.852 --> 58:03.438
...your girlfriend is about
to take her last breath.

58:03.522 --> 58:06.233
Whether she lives or dies
all depends on you.

58:06.316 --> 58:08.735
Where's the casket?

58:08.819 --> 58:10.320
[Yujin gagging]

58:10.404 --> 58:14.241
[Hocheol] Fuck. Better speak up.
She's about to die.

58:16.034 --> 58:18.203
[Yujin screaming]

58:20.163 --> 58:21.665
I don't know.

58:21.748 --> 58:25.168
[Yujin] The mine! The mine! The mine!
It's in the mine. There's a mine.

58:25.252 --> 58:26.712
[Hocheol] Which mine?

58:26.795 --> 58:28.088
[Hocheol snarls]

58:28.171 --> 58:29.464
[Yujin] Here.

58:29.548 --> 58:31.466
[Yujin breathing erratically]

58:31.550 --> 58:33.593
[coughs]
[Yujin] Here.

58:33.677 --> 58:36.346
[breathing heavily]

58:36.430 --> 58:40.559
[Yujin] Wh-When you-when you get
to the end of National Route 7,

58:40.642 --> 58:43.812
inside the very end is drift number eight.

58:43.895 --> 58:45.188
That's where it is.

58:46.732 --> 58:48.442
[Yujin] I'm sorry!

58:48.525 --> 58:51.319
I'm sorry! I swear I didn't steal it!
Please let me live! No!

58:51.403 --> 58:53.530
Stop, no! Please no!

58:53.613 --> 58:57.284
[Yujin gasping]

58:57.367 --> 58:58.869
[both struggling]

58:58.952 --> 59:00.412
Yujin?

59:00.495 --> 59:04.082
[Hocheol snarling]

59:04.166 --> 59:06.626
[Yujin gagging]

59:15.093 --> 59:18.096
[Hocheol breathing heavily]

59:24.436 --> 59:25.520
[phone beeps]

59:28.106 --> 59:29.107
Heeju.

59:31.735 --> 59:33.403
[Dokyung] Heeju, it's me, Dokyung.

59:33.487 --> 59:34.780
Park found out about the gold bars.

59:34.863 --> 59:36.281
Move them fast.

59:41.161 --> 59:42.162
[gold bars clink]
STYLE
::cue()

59:57.928 --> 01:00:00.931
[grunting]

01:00:02.766 --> 01:00:03.767
Shit.

01:00:03.850 --> 01:00:06.853
[bars clinking]

01:00:40.679 --> 01:00:43.682
[♪ dramatic music]

01:00:50.814 --> 01:00:55.443
[Male Singer] ♪ Another day another hour ♪

01:00:55.527 --> 01:00:59.823
♪ Free falling in my mind ♪

01:00:59.906 --> 01:01:06.913
♪ I will find all of the reasons
for leaving ♪

01:01:09.249 --> 01:01:14.337
♪ When everyone around me's changing ♪

01:01:14.421 --> 01:01:18.800
♪ Everyone but me ♪

01:01:18.884 --> 01:01:23.221
♪ All the things I thought I could be ♪

01:01:24.306 --> 01:01:26.766
♪ Are out of reach ♪

01:01:28.685 --> 01:01:33.273
♪ I leave it all behind ♪

01:01:33.356 --> 01:01:37.319
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:01:37.402 --> 01:01:41.907
♪ I'm not expecting any light
at your door ♪

01:01:41.990 --> 01:01:43.658
♪ There's nothing left ♪

01:01:43.742 --> 01:01:49.998
♪ Just the pieces of everything
we could have been before ♪

01:01:50.081 --> 01:01:54.294
♪ Evermore ♪

01:01:54.377 --> 01:02:00.216
♪ I don't feel it like I used to ♪

01:02:00.300 --> 01:02:02.552
♪ Anymore ♪

01:02:15.190 --> 01:02:19.778
♪ You could find me in the dark ♪

01:02:19.861 --> 01:02:24.074
♪ Still calling through the night ♪

01:02:24.157 --> 01:02:29.037
♪ I leave behind all of the seasons ♪

01:02:29.120 --> 01:02:31.790
I've dreamed of ♪

01:02:34.167 --> 01:02:41.091
♪ But the water's rising over
everything I've known ♪

01:02:41.174 --> 01:02:47.180
♪ Drifting out here all alone ♪

01:02:48.807 --> 01:02:52.894
♪ On your own ♪

01:02:52.978 --> 01:02:57.524
♪ So leave it all behind ♪

01:02:57.607 --> 01:03:01.987
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:03:02.070 --> 01:03:06.366
♪ I'm not expecting any light
at your door ♪

01:03:06.449 --> 01:03:08.034
♪ There's nothing left ♪

01:03:08.118 --> 01:03:14.249
♪ Just the pieces of everything
we could have been before ♪

01:03:14.332 --> 01:03:18.628
♪ Evermore ♪

01:03:18.712 --> 01:03:24.509
♪ I don't feel it like I used to ♪

01:03:24.592 --> 01:03:26.386
♪ Anymore ♪
